            {
              "_key": "9c3ecfcedc19",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Advanced Defense Capabilities. Delivered at Fixed-Price Scale."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h5"
        },
        {
          "_key": "55dbdfd7815f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "377f5d3c029d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The traditional defense acquisition system is structurally broken: cost-plus contracting incentivizes multi-decade delays and exponential cost overruns. Conrad inverts this paradigm through private capital R&D, commercial off-the-shelf automotive and aerospace supply chains, and fixed-price defense deliveries."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b55cb9bd6c01",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "5ffd4792df4e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "We need orders of magnitude more weapons. This requires a new product, and we are making an even larger investment to deliver it. This product is not a weapon itself, but a maker of weapons. We call it Arsenal."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
